<title>CHINA: China January coal output reach 109.33 mln tonnes.</title>
<headline>China January coal output reach 109.33 mln tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>China produced 109.33 million tonnes of coal in January, up 0.6 percent compared with January 1996, the State Statistical Bureau said on Thursday.</p>
<p>China produced 1.374 billion tonnes of coal in 1996, up 6.37 percent from 1995, the bureau has said.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1961</p>
</text>
